      "writtenOn": "2025-11-26T17:29:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Revisiting: I don\u0027t think `asLegacyBitmap` works with graphite either, so the previous version of the GM was already broken with graphite.\n\nUnless you really want to make the GM portable in this change, I would skip the complexity and just use readpixels.",
